==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
**3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite the relative strength of the Aku Doges compared to the other enemies here, basic labyrinth fodder will usually be enough to deal with this stage. The Aku Doges are very finite and after that, the stage lacks pushing power to actually threaten you.

